<title>COTE D'IVOIRE: Ivorian cocoa product December exports up on 95.</title>
<headline>Ivorian cocoa product December exports up on 95.</headline>
<dateline>ABIDJAN 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ivory Coast exported 7,160 tonnes of semi-finished cocoa products and powder in December against 8,778 tonnes in November, official shipping data show.</p>
<p>Exports in December 1995 were 4,565 tonnes.</p>
<p>The data do not separate liquor, butter and cake shipments.</p>
<p>Product shipments from Abidjan totalled 5,508 tonnes, including 744 tonnes of powder, whereas San Pedro shipped 1,652 tonnes of cocoa products shown grouped together in one category.</p>
<p>Powder shipments from Abidjan totalled 435 tonnes in 1995/96.</p>
<p>Cumulative product and powder shipments in the first three months of the 1996/97 (Oct-Sept) season were 23,009 tonnes.</p>
<p>--Matthew Bunce, Abidjan Newsroom + 225 21 90 90</p>
